## What I built
Following the established `RegionSettings`/`AISettings` architecture, **10 files** (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/GasPriceSettings.*`, 2064 lines) decomposed as: main view, Adapter, Projection, Model (seams + `@Observable` view‑model), Views, States, Previews, two `*Tests.swift`, and a `.strings` catalog.

**Parity with the web source:** fuel‑pump header + title/subtitle, the auto‑poll toggle (Play/Pause · Running/Stopped) in a labelled field with a HelpIcon, the poll‑interval menu select (Daily/Weekly/Bi‑weekly/Monthly) + HelpIcon, Current Price + Last Polled cells, and the "Poll Now" action with the EIA source caption. `formatCurrency`/unit, the `—` price fallback, and the `formatDateTime`/"Never" (Go zero‑time) sentinel are ported faithfully. All three mutations (toggle/interval/poll) route through a P1/S8 source seam with `toast.info` success feedback; every state renders (loading/empty/error/data + live/stale/offline with stale auto‑refresh); all strings go through the P1/S10 facade; VoiceOver labels on every control; `view.opened` telemetry.

